<title>USA: Manufactured Home Communities sets payout.</title>
<headline>Manufactured Home Communities sets payout.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarterly</p>
<p>			  Latest		     Prior</p>
<p> Amount		  $0.33		    $0.305</p>
<p> Pay		  April 11</p>
<p> Record	     March 28</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name is Manufactured Home Communities Inc.</p>
<p>The company announced on November 13 it increased its annual dividend by eight percent to $1.32 a share, or $0.33 on a quarterly basis.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
